 Isn't bat a totem of the shadow Lords in modern times?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yes and serves as a Totem to a camp of Shadow Lords. I have several ideas for reviving the Camazotz, some of which are doable others I'm not sure. Either way the return of the Camazotz should be epic and not a simple hand-waving of Bat is redeemed bam here come the Camazotz.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/293-lncbill","name":"lncbill","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar293_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-30T21:11:40-07:00","id":979472,"title":"","content":"The first few moments of ecstacetsy after conquering such bondage, your unlikely to be wholly rational but good point.<br /> <br /> Another Idea is for him to be secretive and to instead of resigning as a wyrm totem &quot;and by the way, might I suggest a little vacation in Erebus, it will do you good!?&quot;<br /> <br /> He'd try using the Dancers who'd patronizing him into unwittingly sabotaging the Wyrms war effort.<br /> <br /> Is that too horrible a betrayal or appropiate to him?<br /> <br /> And yes, an aspect of bat DOES serve Shadow Lords<br /> <br /> wonder how packs of Dancers and Shadow Lords who both Serve bat, will see each other, find common ground, or hate each other all the more.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" s